    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d950">

                <pb facs="1020" n="1010" sameAs="frus:frus1949v09/pg1010"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">893.6363/4–2949: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Consul General at Shanghai</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Cabot</hi>) <hi
                        rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Shanghai</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1949-04-29T13:00:00+08:00">April 29, 1949—1
                            p. m.</date>
                        <lb/> [Received 6:20 p. m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>1437. Approximate total current POL stocks available Shanghai area (Department’s
                    730, April 22, repeated Canton 104) including released, bonded free and bonded
                    committed, in barrels of 42 American gallons follow. <table cols="3" rows="10">
                        <row role="label">
                            <cell>
                                <hi rendition="#italic">Quantity</hi>
                            </cell>
                            <cell>
                                <hi rendition="#italic">Product</hi>
                            </cell>
                            <cell>
                                <hi rendition="#italic">Estimated Days Supply Civilian
                                    Consumption</hi>
                            </cell>
                        </row>
                        <row>
                            <cell role="num">71,201</cell>
                            <cell>avigas</cell>
                            <cell role="num">54</cell>
                        </row>
                        <row>
                            <cell role="num">137,893</cell>
                            <cell>mogas</cell>
                            <cell role="num">103</cell>
                        </row>
                        <row>
                            <cell role="num">144,727</cell>
                            <cell>kerosene</cell>
                            <cell role="num">177</cell>
                        </row>
                        <row>
                            <cell role="num">109,569</cell>
                            <cell>light Diesel</cell>
                            <cell role="num">80</cell>
                        </row>
                        <row>
                            <cell role="num">215,158</cell>
                            <cell>medium Diesel</cell>
                            <cell role="num">105</cell>
                        </row>
                        <row>
                            <cell role="num">338,539</cell>
                            <cell>fuel oil</cell>
                            <cell role="num">27</cell>
                        </row>
                        <row>
                            <cell role="num">66,863</cell>
                            <cell>lub oils</cell>
                            <cell role="num">95</cell>
                        </row>
                        <row>
                            <cell role="num">7,073</cell>
                            <cell>greases</cell>
                            <cell role="num">206</cell>
                        </row>
                        <row>
                            <cell role="num">104,629</cell>
                            <cell>crude oil</cell>
                            <cell role="num">43</cell>
                        </row>
                    </table>
                </p>
                <p>Oil companies diverting en route tankers to Hong Kong, Taiwan or South China
                    ports and being requested if feasible move out excess inventories Shanghai
                    bonded free stocks.</p>
                <p>Sent Department 1437, repeated Off Emb Canton 369.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Cabot</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
